Monkeys roar and meet Dhūmrākṣa host with trees and stones --- Demons cut monkeys with arrows while monkeys crush demons --- Dhūmrākṣa routs monkeys with showers of arrows --- Hanumān hurls rock and wrecks Dhūmrākṣa chariot --- Dhūmrākṣa clubs Hanumān head with spiked mace --- Hanumān drops mountain peak and kills Dhūmrākṣa --- Surviving demons flee to Laṅkā while monkeys honor Hanumān